      "role": "user",
      "content": "encephalitis? that sounds really scary... i dont want to make a big deal out of nothing if it's just the fever. he's always been a little out of it sometimes lol. do you really think it's worth a trip to the ER at 2am? he's mostly just sleepy and quiet right now, nothing crazy.",
